// Startup Item File Created - MacOS | T1037.005 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/macos/file_event/file_event_macos_susp_startup_item_created.yml
DeviceFileEvents
| where (FolderPath startswith "/Library/StartupItems/" or FolderPath startswith "/System/Library/StartupItems") and FolderPath endswith ".plist"
